        "name": "Webhook - single payload [mapping pending]"
      },
      "description": "Expected payload: {run_id, scenario_id, mode: \"single\", pipeline_version}. JSON-to-question/runtime adapter remains unwired.",
      "name": "Webhook - single payload [mapping pending]",
      "ui": {
